{"id":"3e076117a0acde14","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-degree-eventually-cupping.md","title":"Every Sufficiently Large Degree Is Cupping","display":"thm-degree-eventually-cupping — Every Sufficiently Large Degree Is Cupping","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-degree-eventually-cupping","aliases":["67-thm-degree-eventually-cupping"],"display":"thm-degree-eventually-cupping — Every Sufficiently Large Degree Is Cupping","depends_on":["[[67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]","[[67-df-degree-cofinality]]","[[67-df-degree-structure]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"7","source_label":"Corollary 7.3, from Theorem 7.4 and Lemma 7.9","source_printed_pages":[98,99],"source_pdf_pages":[109,110],"verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-degree-eventually-cupping"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-degree-eventually-cupping</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-degree-eventually-cupping — Every Sufficiently Large Degree Is Cupping"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5d746ea1792bf7\" href=\"?note=dd5d746ea1792bf7\" title=\"67-df-degree-cupping-capping\">67-df-degree-cupping-capping</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ee1f80d5a223006\" href=\"?note=7ee1f80d5a223006\" title=\"67-df-degree-cofinality\">67-df-degree-cofinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"7"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Corollary 7.3, from Theorem 7.4 and Lemma 7.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>98</span><span>99</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>109</span><span>110</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-statement-and-book-argument-read; auxiliary proof chain not independently reconstructed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf1_T\">\\(T,D_T,\\leq_T,&lt;_T,\\mathbf1_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cupping}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Cupping}_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dd5d746ea1792bf7\" href=\"?note=dd5d746ea1792bf7\" title=\"67-df-degree-cupping-capping\">67-df-degree-cupping-capping</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Eventually}_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7ee1f80d5a223006\" href=\"?note=7ee1f80d5a223006\" title=\"67-df-degree-cofinality\">67-df-degree-cofinality</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(\\{a\\in D_T:\\mathrm{Cupping}_T(a)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(\\{a\\in D_T:\\mathrm{Cupping}_T(a)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应印刷99页/PDF110页推论3，依赖印刷98–99页/PDF109–110页定理4及引理9。来源先证明由各种 PR binumeration 的一致性句给出的非顶度皆 cupping，再证明这些度严格共尾。</p>\n<p>向上保持的格论论证：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> cupping 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\leq b&lt;c&lt;1\">\\(a\\leq b&lt;c&lt;1\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d&lt;c\">\\(d&lt;c\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\vee d=c\">\\(a\\vee d=c\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\vee d=c\">\\(b\\vee d=c\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 也 cupping；所以每个共尾的一致性度给出所需尾段。本轮已读这条推导，但上游对任意 PR binumeration 的一致性句构造未全部独立核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-cupping-capping","status":"resolved","id":"dd5d746ea1792bf7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"7ee1f80d5a223006","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-cofinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\mathrm{Cupping}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-cupping-capping","status":"resolved","id":"dd5d746ea1792bf7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$\\mathrm{Cupping}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-cupping-capping]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"7ee1f80d5a223006","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Eventually}_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-cofinality]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,D_T,\\leq_T,<_T,\\mathbf1_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cupping}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Eventually}_T(\\{a\\in D_T:\\mathrm{Cupping}_T(a)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"a\\leq b<c<1","display":false},{"tex":"d<c","display":false},{"tex":"a\\vee d=c","display":false},{"tex":"b\\vee d=c","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false}],"bytes":1826,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-degree-eventually-cupping]]"}],"outgoing":["dd5d746ea1792bf7","7ee1f80d5a223006","f5b9611e728efd8b"]}